Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.38,0:00:53.80,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.80,0:00:57.97,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.97,0:01:02.35,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.35,0:01:08.11,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.11,0:01:14.11,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.11,0:01:16.86,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.86,0:01:22.74,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.74,0:01:25.79,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.79,0:01:31.63,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.63,0:01:34.72,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.38,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.38,0:01:43.10,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.10,0:01:46.14,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.14,0:01:48.90,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.77,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.77,0:01:54.49,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.49,0:02:01.45,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:17.81,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5}A lua se afasta durante o amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:24.44,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}escondendo-se na brilhante luz forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:30.74,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Minhas emoções dão voltas infinitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:37.87,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,800)\blur5}enquanto tento conectar um coração ao outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.71,0:22:53.34,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Uma oração distante...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:56.93,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Se a paz em que acreditávamos fosse uma mentira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:01.56,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H51AFC3&}enganarei meu coração com tudo que tenho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:06.36,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}e vestirei a mim mesma com um fogo inspirador!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:09.78,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}O jardim da criação não causa mais que destruição
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.37,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}mesmo tendo uma espada de dois gumes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:19.18,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}continue lutando com tudo que tem...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:24.29,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\blur5\3c&HB2B865&}Meu pequeno trapaceiro!
